OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to demolish 'eyesore' pub
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to demolish an "eyesore" pub and
OL,7,Freplace it with affordable homes have
OL,8,Fbeen approved.
OL,10,FThe former Nautical William pub in
OL,11,FWigston was left empty after going out
OL,12,Fof business five years ago.
OL,14,FPeople in the area have voiced concerns
OL,15,Fabout the state of the building, which
OL,16,Fhas been a hotspot for antisocial
OL,17,Fbehaviour.
OL,19,FOadby and Wigston Borough Council
OL,20,F(OWBC) has now approved plans to tear
OL,21,Fthe building down and build 14
OL,22,Faffordable homes.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
